@* =====================================================================
   FILE: MerkaiTrial.Admin.Web/Pages/_ViewStart.cshtml   (SIMPLIFIED)

   Was: a route-path check selecting between two layouts. That duplicated
   what Pages/Admin/_ViewStart.cshtml already does — Razor runs _ViewStart
   files root-to-leaf and the deepest one wins, so the Admin folder's file
   was always the effective setting and the path test never changed an
   outcome. One rule, one place.
   ===================================================================== *@
@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
}